Till Tokyo Tower, tack.

327
00:15:44,926 --> 00:15:47,292
Tokyo Tower, javisst.

328
00:15:47,315 --> 00:15:49,253
Uppfattat.

329
00:15:49,277 --> 00:15:52,648
Hur lång tid tar det?

330
